=2 Walkthrough
* You'll automatically be in {z:Grauberg (S)}'s {p:Witchfire Glen} and on this mission after the previous cutscene.
** Other players who've already done the mission (and helping newer players) are able to use the Walk of Echoes Veridical Conflux to teleport to Witchfire Glen's Veridical Conflux; however, they won't be able to use the **???** for a return trip at the end of this mission.
* Examine the blue glowing **???** closest to the spot you were teleported to in {z:Grauberg (S)} to spawn {m:Cetus}.
** The correct **???** is NE of the {p:Veridical Conflux} and not the one right beside it.
** Note: Cetus gains {s:Dread Spikes} after **Aetheric Pull**, so beware if you're a returning player using older gear.
* Re-examine the **???** for a cutscene.
* Re-enter {p:Walk of Echoes} for a cutscene by clicking on the **???** beside the Veridical Conflux.
* __Note__: If you brought some sort of warp as mentioned in the previous mission, warp back into town.

=2 Notes
* This fight is intended for players that are 99. If you attempt this fight below 99 you may die.
** A solo player with Trusts can complete this in the early level 90s with some difficulty.
* In the event you wipe, you will no longer be able to go back and re-enter by clicking the **???** beside a {p:Cavernous Maw}. You will need to walk to {z:Grauberg (S)} manually.
** If you don't have a {p:Survival Guide} directly to {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} or {z:North Gustaberg (S)} (zones directly connected to Grauberg) follow as such:
*** If you have {z:Rolanberry Fields (S)} use it and follow beneath the next step.
*** Otherwise take the {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Vunkerl Inlet (S)} and make your way to (H-11). This will take you off map and eventually you'll come to a drop at (I-11) you want to take to move towards (J-12), zoning you into {z:Rolanberry Fields (S)}.
*** Make your way down to (I-14), grab the {p:Survival Guide}, and zone into {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)}.
*** This zone is exactly the same as the present (except there's no {z:Konschtat Highlands} yet so the zone is barricaded off). No surprise walls, so head to (G-10) and start hugging the left. This will take you off map to (G-11) where you'll hit the zone line for {z:Grauberg (S)}.
* To make your way back to the **???** to spawn {m:Cetus} again, just head to (F-5) (G/H-6 is a one way drop, so you need to go the longer way).
* Touch the ??? again for a quick CS
* Return to the {p:Walk of Echoes} for CS
** To get the last cutscene, you must be on a {p:Wings of the Goddess} mission where Lilisette is available.

